  <!-- EN: Xenogerm pricing -->
  <XTS_PricingSection>异种胚芽定价</XTS_PricingSection>
  <!-- EN: Market value formula for trader-sold xenogerms. Affects new xenogerms only. -->
  <XTS_PricingSectionDesc>贸易商出售的异种胚芽的市场价值公式。仅影响新生成的异种胚芽。</XTS_PricingSectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Base preset value: {0} -->
  <XTS_BasePresetValue>预设基础价值: {0}</XTS_BasePresetValue>
  <!-- EN: Base silver value added to all preset xenotype xenogerms -->
  <XTS_BasePresetValueDesc>为所有预设异种人异种胚芽增加的基础白银价值</XTS_BasePresetValueDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per metabolism: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerMetabolism>每点代谢率价值: {0}</XTS_ValuePerMetabolism>
  <!-- EN: Silver value added per point of absolute metabolism -->
  <XTS_ValuePerMetabolismDesc>每点绝对代谢率增加的白银价值</XTS_ValuePerMetabolismDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per complexity: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerComplexity>每点复杂度价值: {0}</XTS_ValuePerComplexity>
  <!-- EN: Silver value added per point of genetic complexity -->
  <XTS_ValuePerComplexityDesc>每点基因复杂度增加的白银价值</XTS_ValuePerComplexityDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per archite gene: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerArchite>每个超凡基因价值: {0}</XTS_ValuePerArchite>
  <!-- EN: Silver value added per archite gene -->
  <XTS_ValuePerArchiteDesc>每个超凡基因增加的白银价值</XTS_ValuePerArchiteDesc>

  <!-- EN: Stock quantity -->
  <XTS_QuantitySection>库存数量</XTS_QuantitySection>
  <!-- EN: How many xenogerms each trader kind carries, rolled from its range on every visit. Affects new traders only. -->
  <XTS_QuantitySectionDesc>每种贸易商携带的异种胚芽数量，每次到访时都会在其范围内重新随机。仅影响新生成的贸易商。</XTS_QuantitySectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: {0}: {1}~{2} -->
  <XTS_TraderCount>{0}: {1}~{2}</XTS_TraderCount>
  <!-- EN: {0} (orbital) -->
  <XTS_TraderOrbital>{0}（轨道）</XTS_TraderOrbital>
  <!-- EN: {0} (caravan) -->
  <XTS_TraderCaravan>{0}（远行队）</XTS_TraderCaravan>
  <!-- EN: Xenogerms this trader arrives with, rolled from this range each visit -->
  <XTS_TraderCountDesc>该贸易商到访时携带的异种胚芽数量，每次到访都会在此范围内重新随机</XTS_TraderCountDesc>

  <!-- EN: Implantation -->
  <XTS_ImplantationSection>植入</XTS_ImplantationSection>
  <!-- EN: How trader-sold xenogerms behave when implanted. -->
  <XTS_ImplantationSectionDesc>贸易商出售的异种胚芽在植入时的行为方式。</XTS_ImplantationSectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Implant germline xenotypes as endogenes -->
  <XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenes>将系谱异种人作为系谱基因植入</XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenes>
  <!-- EN: Preserve deathrest capacity through implantation -->
  <XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacity>植入时保留死眠容量</XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacity>
  <!-- EN: Vanilla recreates the deathrest gene on every xenogerm implant or sanguophage reimplant, resetting serum-bought deathrest capacity to one. With this on, the pawn's previous capacity is restored whenever it still has a deathrest gene afterwards. Applies to all xenogerms, not just trader-sold ones. -->
  <XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacityDesc>原版游戏在每次植入异种胚芽，或使用赫血种的“植入基因”能力时，都会重建死眠基因，将用血清购买的死眠容量重置为1。开启此项后，只要角色植入后仍拥有死眠基因，其此前的容量就会被恢复。适用于所有异种胚芽，不仅限于贸易商出售的异种胚芽。</XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacityDesc>
  <!-- EN: When a trader-sold xenogerm for a germline xenotype is implanted, its genes replace the pawn's endogenes instead of becoming xenogenes, making the pawn a born member of that xenotype: children inherit the genes, and later xenogerm implants add to them instead of overwriting them. Xenogenes the pawn already carries are kept, and a pawn named for them (a sanguophage, say) keeps its name and icon. -->
  <XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenesDesc>植入贸易商出售的系谱异种人异种胚芽时，其基因会替换角色的系谱基因，而不是成为异种基因，使角色成为该异种人的天生成员：其子女将遗传这些基因，此后植入的异种胚芽会在此基础上叠加，而不是将其覆盖。角色原有的异种基因会被保留，若角色因这些异种基因而得名（例如赫血种），则会保留其名称与图标。</XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenesDesc>

  <!-- EN: Xenotype commonality by price -->
  <XTS_CommonalitySection>按价格决定的异种人常见度</XTS_CommonalitySection>
  <!-- EN: How a trader picks which xenotypes to stock, weighted by the prices of everything currently sellable. Affects new stock only. -->
  <XTS_CommonalitySectionDesc>贸易商如何挑选要进货的异种人，权重取决于当前所有可出售异种人的价格。仅影响新生成的库存。</XTS_CommonalitySectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Inverse -->
  <XTS_StrategyInversePrice>反比</XTS_StrategyInversePrice>
  <!-- EN: Cheaper xenogerms are more common: chance is proportional to 1 / price. Archite xenogerms stay rare. -->
  <XTS_StrategyInversePriceDesc>更便宜的异种胚芽更常见：概率与 1 / 价格 成正比。超凡异种胚芽依然罕见。</XTS_StrategyInversePriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Inverse root -->
  <XTS_StrategySoftInversePrice>平方根反比</XTS_StrategySoftInversePrice>
  <!-- EN: Cheaper xenogerms are more common, with a gentler bias: chance is proportional to 1 / √price. -->
  <XTS_StrategySoftInversePriceDesc>更便宜的异种胚芽更常见，但偏向更为温和：概率与 1 / √价格 成正比。</XTS_StrategySoftInversePriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Linear -->
  <XTS_StrategyPrice>线性</XTS_StrategyPrice>
  <!-- EN: Pricier xenogerms are more common: chance is proportional to price. -->
  <XTS_StrategyPriceDesc>更昂贵的异种胚芽更常见：概率与价格成正比。</XTS_StrategyPriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Square root -->
  <XTS_StrategySqrtPrice>平方根</XTS_StrategySqrtPrice>
  <!-- EN: Pricier xenogerms are more common, with a gentler bias: chance is proportional to √price. -->
  <XTS_StrategySqrtPriceDesc>更昂贵的异种胚芽更常见，但偏向更为温和：概率与 √价格 成正比。</XTS_StrategySqrtPriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Bell curve -->
  <XTS_StrategyBellCurve>钟形曲线</XTS_StrategyBellCurve>
  <!-- EN: Mid-priced xenogerms are most common: chances follow a bell curve centred on the median price, so the cheapest and priciest are both rare. -->
  <XTS_StrategyBellCurveDesc>中等价位的异种胚芽最为常见：概率遵循以价格中位数为中心的钟形曲线分布，因此最便宜和最昂贵的都很罕见。</XTS_StrategyBellCurveDesc>
  <!-- EN: Uniform -->
  <XTS_StrategyUniform>均匀</XTS_StrategyUniform>
  <!-- EN: Every sellable xenotype is equally likely, regardless of price. -->
  <XTS_StrategyUniformDesc>无论价格高低，每种可出售的异种人被选中的概率都相同。</XTS_StrategyUniformDesc>

  <!-- EN:  (default) -->
  <XTS_DefaultSuffix>（默认）</XTS_DefaultSuffix>
  <!-- EN: Reset to defaults -->
  <XTS_ResetToDefaults>还原默认设置</XTS_ResetToDefaults>

</LanguageData>
